[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4640009334","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120049#issuecomment-4640009334","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120049","id":4640009334,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFJDsdg","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-06T18:45:49Z","updated_at":"2026-06-06T18:45:49Z","body":"Ah, this seems to have been caused by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110556. @Ivorforce is this intentional?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4640009334/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4640023778","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120049#issuecomment-4640023778","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120049","id":4640023778,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFJEk4g","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-06T18:52:53Z","updated_at":"2026-06-06T18:52:53Z","body":"This is expected, `NUL` characters currently are not valid in the string (only used as string terminator). Valid ranges for `char` are `0x0001` to `0xD7FF` and `0xE000` to `0x10FFFF`.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4640023778/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4640027068","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120049#issuecomment-4640027068","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120049","id":4640027068,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFJExvA","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-06T18:54:25Z","updated_at":"2026-06-06T18:54:40Z","body":"For context, seems like GDScript tries to compile time eval some functions. The lack of proper error propagation makes it basically impossible to handle errors during that though.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4640027068/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4640390102","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120049#issuecomment-4640390102","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120049","id":4640390102,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFJa71g","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-06T21:19:36Z","updated_at":"2026-06-06T21:19:36Z","body":"> For context, seems like GDScript tries to compile time eval some functions. The lack of proper error propagation makes it basically impossible to handle errors during that though.\n\nThis is what concerns me mostly, the error in this scenario is too cryptic right now. It took me some weeks while refactoring my addon to understand the issue was not in my code, but instead in a random test scene with embedded GDScript.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4640390102/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4640415758","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120049#issuecomment-4640415758","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120049","id":4640415758,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFJcgDg","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-06T21:32:06Z","updated_at":"2026-06-06T21:34:21Z","body":"`\\0` is technically a valid unicode string; however Godot currently doesn't handle it correctly since some of its own APIs assume strings are `\\0` free and additionally `\\0` terminated.\nI've been slowly addressing this problem since 2 years; some of my fixes involved printing more errors to avoid worse bugs down the line.\n\nIn other words, Godot is currently incapable of handling a `char(0)` correctly right now, so the call itself errors and produces a length one string with the replacement character instead.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4640415758/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4670742131","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120049#issuecomment-4670742131","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120049","id":4670742131,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFmXecw","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-10T13:30:27Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T13:30:27Z","body":"> For context, seems like GDScript tries to compile time eval some functions. The lack of proper error propagation makes it basically impossible to handle errors during that though.\n\nFor this particular case, we could modify the condition or add a separate check here (if it is expected that `char(0)` might become valid someday):\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ec67cbe92628bdaf979b10594359ba6f02cf8838/modules/gdscript/gdscript_utility_functions.cpp#L120-L126\n\nUnfortunately in general, but fortunately in situations like this, GDScript can perform compile-time calculations in fairly limited cases, so we could take them into account individually.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4670742131/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4670881817","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120049#issuecomment-4670881817","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120049","id":4670881817,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFmgAGQ","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-10T13:43:36Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T13:45:47Z","body":"> For this particular case, we could modify the condition or add a separate check here (if it is expected that char(0) might become valid someday)\n\nChanging this to the same condition actual string use probably is a good way to fix error spam. Even if we will support `NUL`s in the string, this check is not correct for the rest of range, should be something like:\n```c++\ncode <= 0 || (code & 0xfffff800) == 0xd800 || code > 0x10ffff\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4670881817/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]